TITLE Mix 50 mM DIC with 50 mM Ca (1:1), heat 20 to 200 C, allow calcite ppt/diss

SOLUTION 1 DIC_solution
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50

SOLUTION 2 Ca_solution
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
SAVE solution 3
END

USE solution 3
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 38 56 74 92 110 128 146 164 182 200

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -temperature true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Temp_C Ionic_strength
    10 PUNCH TC, MU
END
